Comment: 0,0:22:17.57,0:22:20.09,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}テレスコープのぞいて
Comment: 0,0:22:20.09,0:22:22.44,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}見つめてる君
Comment: 0,0:22:22.87,0:22:25.51,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}そこにある日常は
Comment: 0,0:22:25.51,0:22:27.52,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}まるでさかさま
Comment: 0,0:22:28.29,0:22:30.89,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}地に足がつかないわ
Comment: 0,0:22:30.89,0:22:33.30,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}こころうわの空
Comment: 0,0:22:33.75,0:22:36.31,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}行き場のない想いは
Comment: 0,0:22:36.31,0:22:38.41,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}苦しくなるだけ
Comment: 0,0:22:43.69,0:22:45.57,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}ああ、辛いや
Comment: 0,0:22:49.90,0:22:52.58,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}“もしも”なんて呪文
Comment: 0,0:22:52.58,0:22:55.31,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}なんの効力もないけど
Comment: 0,0:22:55.64,0:23:00.39,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}全部ぜーんぶ　わたしとならいいのに
Comment: 0,0:23:00.39,0:23:02.70,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}って思ってしまうんだよ
Comment: 0,0:23:02.70,0:23:05.48,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}好きだよ。好き？大好きだ。
Comment: 0,0:23:05.48,0:23:08.12,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}って言えていたのに
Comment: 0,0:23:08.12,0:23:10.33,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}食べかけのフローズン
Comment: 0,0:23:10.33,0:23:13.71,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}シャリシャリなメモリーズ
Comment: 0,0:23:13.14,0:23:15.17,ED_JP,,0,1200,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fs40\blur3}We’re stuck in Love
Comment: 0,0:23:14.54,0:23:16.52,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}足りない　足りない　足りない
Comment: 0,0:23:16.52,0:23:19.05,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}君成分が足りない
Comment: 0,0:23:18.58,0:23:20.55,ED_JP,,0,1200,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fs40\blur3}We’re stuck in Love
Comment: 0,0:23:19.85,0:23:21.24,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}触れたい　触れたい
Comment: 0,0:23:21.24,0:23:24.48,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}冷たい愛凍えちゃう前に
Comment: 0,0:23:24.69,0:23:28.01,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}温めてよね　お願い
Comment: 0,0:22:17.57,0:22:20.09,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}透過望遠鏡
Comment: 0,0:22:20.09,0:22:22.44,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}注視著的你
Comment: 0,0:22:22.87,0:22:25.51,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}眼前的日常
Comment: 0,0:22:25.51,0:22:27.52,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}彷彿顛倒一樣
Comment: 0,0:22:28.29,0:22:30.89,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}雙腳無法踏實著地
Comment: 0,0:22:30.89,0:22:33.30,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}心思早已浮上雲端
Comment: 0,0:22:33.75,0:22:36.31,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}無處安放的心意
Comment: 0,0:22:36.31,0:22:38.41,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}只會感到痛苦
Comment: 0,0:22:43.69,0:22:45.57,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}啊 好難受
Comment: 0,0:22:49.90,0:22:52.58,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}「假如」這類的咒語
Comment: 0,0:22:52.58,0:22:55.31,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}雖然沒有任何效果
Comment: 0,0:22:55.64,0:23:00.39,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}全部全部 都能和我一起就好了
Comment: 0,0:23:00.39,0:23:02.70,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}還是忍不住會這樣想
Comment: 0,0:23:02.70,0:23:05.48,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}喜歡你。喜歡？超喜歡。
Comment: 0,0:23:05.48,0:23:08.12,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}明明能說得出口
Comment: 0,0:23:08.12,0:23:10.33,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}吃到一半的冰沙
Comment: 0,0:23:10.33,0:23:13.71,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}留下沙沙作響的回憶
Comment: 0,0:23:13.14,0:23:15.17,ED_CN,,0,1200,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fs35\blur3}We're stuck in Love
Comment: 0,0:23:14.54,0:23:16.52,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}不夠 不夠 還不夠
Comment: 0,0:23:16.52,0:23:19.05,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}你的成分還不夠
Comment: 0,0:23:18.58,0:23:20.55,ED_CN,,0,1200,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fs35\blur3}We're stuck in Love
Comment: 0,0:23:19.85,0:23:21.24,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}想觸碰 想觸碰
Comment: 0,0:23:21.24,0:23:24.48,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}在冰冷的愛凍結之前
Comment: 0,0:23:24.69,0:23:28.01,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}請你將它溫暖起來
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
